# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep secrets and host-built artifacts out of
# the image. A copied node_modules from the host would also break native modules built for a
# different libc.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.git
**/.gitignore

# NEVER ship real configuration. .env.example is committed and carries no values.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Documentation and AI-DLC artifacts are not needed at runtime.
aidlc-docs
.aidlc*
**/*.md
!README.md
